# Google reviews (optional). Without these, the site shows links to the Google Business Profile.
# Create the key in Google Cloud > APIs & Services, enable "Places API (New)" and restrict the key to that API.
# Set the values in Vercel > Project > Settings > Environment Variables. Never commit a real .env.
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=
# Optional: if empty, the site finds the Place ID once by text search and caches the result.
GOOGLE_PLACE_ID=
